# FOLIAGE-PROOF: the landed foliage on FIELD_Barn in one run - GPU grass + blades to the horizon, the procedural scatter (S1),
# wind on grass and leaves, leaves lit through from behind and contact shadows at the grass roots. Code is not changed.
# The Bistro half (frame 4) is FOLIAGE-PROOF-BISTRO.scn: a scenario opens one project, Bistro is its own content project.
# Sun aim: toward-sun = (cos El * sin Az, sin El, cos El * cos Az) (PORT-SUN-ROTATION: El 5 / Az 54.5 = +X+Z).
Дано run Scene "Open Scene FIELD_Barn.desce"
# The view mode is the editor's saved one (the first run came up in Wireframe: ISMs refused, barn as lines): set it.
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Entity "Sun"
Дано --subject selection set SunElevation 40
Дано --subject selection set SunAzimuth 20
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.FOV 70
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,900,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.15,-1
Тогда-вид 1_field_grass GPU grass and blades to the horizon with no holes along cells; the scattered trees/shrubs (S1) read as a field, not a grid
# GI cost by pass (UE ProfileGPU / stat gpu: Lumen Scene Update, Screen Probe Gather, Reflections read from their
# own rows): timestamps on, two averaging windows of frames, one [GpuProfile] line per pass into editor.log, off.
# The averaging window is the wind step's 2 s of Play (DesertCtl `frames N` is not in dev: SCN-VERBS 93080ac1c).
Когда run Debug "GPU profiling: On"
Когда run Action Simulate
Когда advance 2
Когда run Debug "Log GPU pass timings"
Когда run Debug "GPU profiling: Off"
Тогда-вид 2_field_wind the same view: grass and leaves displaced by the wind against 1_field_grass
Когда run Action Stop
# Against the sun: low sun (El 12) straight ahead of the camera (Az 180 = -Z), the tree line between.
Когда run Entity "Sun"
Когда --subject selection set SunElevation 12
Когда --subject selection set SunAzimuth 180
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -1500,450,-2800
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,0.05,-1
Тогда-вид 3_field_backlit leaves glow with the sun behind them (transmission through the leaf); contact shadows dark at the grass roots
